      "text": "L = alpha * L_ranking + beta * L_language + gamma * L_misc\nL_ranking conceptually averages: w_j * CE(target item, predicted catalog distribution)\nUpdate LLM weights, ranking-head parameters, and item embeddings e_i together.\nh is an activation, not a separately stored user-vector parameter.",
      "originalText": "L = alpha * L_ranking + beta * L_language + gamma * L_misc\nL_ranking conceptually averages: w_j * CE(target item, predicted catalog distribution)\nUpdate LLM weights, ranking-head parameters, and item embeddings e_i together.\nh is an activation, not a separately stored user-vector parameter.",
